📘 Overview

The Aetheris Emergence Engine is a Level‑9 autonomous simulation system designed to generate, evaluate, and stabilize unknown molecular and unknown‑matter structures.It operates through a sealed, physics‑driven loop combining:

Unknown‑State Field Dynamics

Topology Extraction

