This README provides a conceptual and architectural overview for developers, researchers, and engineers interacting with the engine.

🧠 Core Concepts

Unknown‑State Field (Ψ_unk)

A Gaussian‑cluster superposition field representing unknown matter.It evolves under a custom operator L_unk, producing emergent structures.

Topology Extractor (M)

Converts field geometry into candidate molecular graphs (V, E).

Thermodynamic‑Cryptographic Key (K(t))

A live key derived from entropy and flux divergence.Controls access, stability, and acceptance of emergent structures.

Encrypted Acceptance Gate

Filters candidate structures using Gate(K) to produce stable outputs Φ(t).

Suprakernel Authority

Ensures isolation, consistency, and sovereign execution.

